{"availability":"available","full":"verssache/qris-dinamis","name":"qris-dinamis","description":"Convert static QRIS to dynamic — parse, validate, and generate QR codes for the Indonesian payment system.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":515,"forks":111,"created":"2020-11-05T13:56:18Z","updated":"2026-04-01T10:49:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://qris-dinamis-ten.vercel.app","topics":["qris","qris-dinamis"],"demo":"https://qris-dinamis-ten.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T16:59:25.723Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T16:59:25.723Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T16:59:25.723Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:33:04.892Z","stars":503,"forks":109},{"at":"2026-10-08T00:28:08.925Z","stars":504,"forks":109},{"at":"2026-10-10T03:21:59.486Z","stars":509,"forks":111},{"at":"2026-10-15T16:59:25.723Z","stars":515,"forks":111}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["QRIS (Quick Response Code Indonesian Standard) is a unified QR code payment standard developed by Bank Indonesia. It enables interoperable payments across all payment providers (GoPay, OVO, DANA, ShopeePay, bank apps, etc.) through a single QR code.","This tool converts Static → Dynamic by injecting a transaction amount (and optional service fee) into the QRIS payload, then recalculating the CRC16 checksum."],"features":["QRIS Parser — Decode any QRIS string into a structured, human-readable format (merchant name, city, category, issuer, etc.)","Static → Dynamic Converter — Inject amount and optional service fees into a static QRIS","QRIS Validator — Validate QRIS string structure and CRC16 checksum integrity","QR Image Upload — Upload or drag & drop a QR code image to extract the QRIS data","Camera Scanner — Scan QRIS codes directly using your device camera"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/verssache/qris-dinamis/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fab3c85fa7cf477e3e3e51348b7ecaeebd3df7d